      "rev_n_2_b799ec_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_b799ec_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_b799ec",
        "thought_text": "Use a data structure to keep track of scores efficiently.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499705.8723702
      },
      "rev_n_3_8ed592_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_8ed592_0",
        "node_id": "n_3_8ed592",
        "thought_text": "Optimize by avoiding unnecessary score updates.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499705.8723795
      },
      "rev_n_2_b799ec_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_b799ec_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_b799ec",
        "thought_text": "The issue lies in the logic where the score changes are being applied after all questions have been processed. This means that the score changes for a player answering a question are not immediately reflected in the scores of the other players. To fix this, we need to update the scores immediately when a player answers a question, rather than waiting until the end of the game. This ensures that the scores are always up-to-date and accurately reflect the current state of the game.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_b799ec_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_f6a32982b5",
        "created_at": 1794499722.6704984
      },
      "rev_n_1_19e008_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_19e008_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_19e008",
        "thought_text": "Simulate the game process directly but optimize it by keeping track of the total score reduction for each player instead of decrementing scores individually after each question. This reduces the time complexity significantly.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_19e008_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_680314a1ab",
        "created_at": 1794499759.2417035
      },
      "rev_n_3_8ed592_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_8ed592_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_8ed592",
        "thought_text": "Optimize by directly updating the scores of the current player and its two neighbors using modulo arithmetic to handle wrap-around cases.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_8ed592_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_e47a6bf12a",
        "created_at": 1794499787.7942302
      },
      "rev_n_4_fc14c3_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_fc14c3_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_fc14c3",
        "thought_text": "Implement immediate elimination of players with zero or negative scores.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-6662602125234557847",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499802.708345
      },
      "rev_n_5_03fd5b_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_03fd5b_0",
        "node_id": "n_5_03fd5b",
        "thought_text": "Optimize the score update process to avoid unnecessary iterations.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-6662602125234557847",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499802.7083604
      },
      "rev_n_6_286821_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_286821_0",
        "node_id": "n_6_286821",
        "thought_text": "Use a more efficient data structure to keep track of active players.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-6662602125234557847",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499802.7083693
      },
      "rev_n_4_fc14c3_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_fc14c3_1",
        "node_id": "n_4_fc14c3",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Ensure that the score updates and eliminations are handled correctly within the loop, without re-importing sys repeatedly. This will maintain the integrity of the score calculations and eliminate players as soon as their scores drop to zero or below.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-6662602125234557847",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_4_fc14c3_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_559349692b",
        "created_at": 1794499819.3869143
      },
      "rev_n_7_fcd3e0_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_7_fcd3e0_0",
        "node_id": "n_7_fcd3e0",
        "thought_text": "The issue might be related to how we are handling the decrement operations, especially when dealing with the boundaries of the array.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-946702276510760247",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499846.409356
      },
      "rev_n_8_b2a648_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_8_b2a648_0",
        "node_id": "n_8_b2a648",
        "thought_text": "We need to ensure that our logic correctly handles the case where a player's score goes below zero after an update.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-946702276510760247",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499846.4093823
      },
      "rev_n_9_a7a488_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_9_a7a488_0",
        "node_id": "n_9_a7a488",
        "thought_text": "It could be beneficial to re-evaluate the order of operations within the loop to avoid unintended side effects on adjacent players' scores.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-946702276510760247",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794499846.4093897
      },
      "rev_n_7_fcd3e0_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_7_fcd3e0_1",
        "node_id": "n_7_fcd3e0",
        "thought_text": "The issue lies in the logic where we update the scores of neighboring players. Specifically, the increment operation on the next player's score can lead to incorrect results because it does not account for the possibility that the next player's score could already be negative. This can cause the score to become positive again, which is incorrect according to the problem statement. To fix this, we need to ensure that the score of the next player is only incremented if it is currently non-negative.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-946702276510760247",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_7_fcd3e0_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_4308417a43",
        "created_at": 1794499864.6068542
      },
      "rev_n_10_ba6367_0": {
